WEBVTT

00:03:57.400 --> 00:04:00.320
where rock bottom
was possible for the first time.

00:04:01.080 --> 00:04:05.296
And the truth is,
it really doesn't take much.

00:04:05.320 --> 00:04:07.496
The median household in the US

00:04:07.520 --> 00:04:12.056
only has enough savings
to replace one month of income.

00:04:12.080 --> 00:04:13.656
Forty-seven percent of us

00:04:13.680 --> 00:04:18.055
cannot pull together 400 dollars
to deal with an emergency.

00:04:18.079 --> 00:04:19.935
That's almost half of us.

00:04:19.959 --> 00:04:24.000
A major car repair
and we're standing on the abyss.

00:04:24.680 --> 00:04:26.896
You wouldn't know it to look around you --

00:04:26.920 --> 00:04:30.176
I'm not the only one in this situation.